{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"slideshow_CtnG98":{"type":"slideshow","blocks":{"slide_bW6A4P":{"type":"slide","settings":{"background":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1920x1080px_RAM.png","image_overlay_opacity":0,"content_position":"center","text_alignment":"center","text_color":"#000000","title":"","heading_size":"h2","heading_color":"","subheading":"","description":"","desc_size":"text-desc-base","button_text_1":"","button_link_1":"","button_style_1":"btn--primary","button_size_1":"","button_text_2":"","button_link_2":"","button_style_2":"btn--primary","button_size_2":""}}},"block_order":["slide_bW6A4P"],"name":"t:sections.slideshow.name","settings":{"container":"container-full","slideshow_height":"adapt","show_dots":false,"show_nav":false,"autoplay":false,"autorotate_speed":3,"pagination_background":"light","controls_position":"center","pagination_style":"dots","show_text_below":false,"text_alignment_mobile":"center","accessibility_info":"Slideshow about our brand","custom_id":"","custom_class":"","enable_bg_zoom_effect":false}},"jump_links_UeawGp":{"type":"jump-links","blocks":{"link_C8imG8":{"type":"link","settings":{"label":"GVM Packages","target_id":"gvmpackages"}},"link_y9rErk":{"type":"link","settings":{"label":"GVM Specification","target_id":"gvmspecification"}},"link_8FKHCp":{"type":"link","settings":{"label":"Suspension Collection","target_id":"suspensioncollection"}},"link_KmD9dx":{"type":"link","settings":{"label":"GVM Experts","target_id":"gvmexperts"}}},"block_order":["link_C8imG8","link_y9rErk","link_8FKHCp","link_KmD9dx"],"name":"Jump links","settings":{"container_mode":"full","container_width":"1200","bg_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#111111","hover_color":"#111111","active_color":"#111111","border_color":"#0000001f","pad_y":10,"offset":0,"duration":650}},"rich_text_FfDANG":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"text_73Mzb9":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<h3>What benefits does the GVM upgrade offer for my RAM 2500, especially for towing and heavy-duty use?<\/h3><p>When you’re toughing it out and want to push your vehicle to new limits, there’s nothing like a GVM upgrade for RAM 2500s to get the job done. Not only do you get a heavier payload, meaning you can haul more gear or toys to the worksite or into the bush, but you won’t be sacrificing control, safety or performance to do so. GVM upgrades for your RAM 2500 mean you can throw more in the tub, tow heavier trailers - whether that’s a caravan or boat trailer - while experiencing the same, if not better, handling and braking. <br\/><\/p><h3>What are the key differences between the GVM upgrade stages for the RAM 2500, and which one should I choose?<\/h3><p>We offer multiple stages to suit the different levels of demand you have for your truck. They offer different specifications and Category changes, meaning that - no matter how you drive or what you need - you’ll find a kit compatible with your RAM 2500. Our Stage One and Two kits are ideal for work-use and daily extras, like putting heavier gear in the tub or loading up a trailer. <\/p><p>If you’re looking for something with serious extra ground clearance and major hauling power, Three, Four, or Five are more likely to deliver what you need. Each kit combines top of the line aftermarket parts, with our own range of leaf kits for extra support. If you’re unsure which kit is best, you can <a href=\"https:\/\/www.offroadindustries.com.au\/pages\/contact-us\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">contact<\/span><\/a> our team for more information. <br\/><\/p><h3>How does Fox suspension improve the overall handling and ride quality of my RAM 2500 with the GVM upgrade?<\/h3><p>When you have greater suspension and support across your wheelbase and frame, you’ll be braced against buckling, won’t be increasing the risk of rolling, while also being able to maintain - or even improve - your usual driving experience. When you get a RAM 2500 GVM upgrade with Offroad, you can expect superior handling, hard-wearing upgrades that can handle everything the Australian conditions throw at them, and a smoother ride, no matter where the journey takes you. <br\/><\/p><h3>Can I use my factory wheels with the GVM upgrade for the RAM 2500, or do I need to upgrade them?<\/h3><p>Depending on the Stage you opt for, you may need to upgrade your wheels to match the new payload your truck can handle. This is especially true for when your upgrades change the Category of your vehicle. <\/p><p>Equally, one of the big benefits of upgrading your GVM is that you’ll have new <a href=\"https:\/\/www.offroadindustries.com.au\/collections\/suspension\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">suspension<\/span><\/a> with increased ground clearance. To maximise the benefits you get from this, getting <a href=\"https:\/\/www.offroadindustries.com.au\/collections\/4-play-wheels\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">custom wheels<\/span><\/a> can give you better traction, control and improve your truck’s manoeuvrability and give you a more rugged look. <br\/><\/p><h3>How does Offroad Industries ensure that the GVM upgrade complies with Australian standards and regulations?<\/h3><p>We can recommend <a href=\"https:\/\/www.offroadindustries.com.au\/pages\/dealers-page\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">authorised installers<\/span><\/a> throughout Australia when it comes to getting your new upgrades taken care of. Not only are they more than capable of dealing with aftermarket parts from American-made brands including <a href=\"https:\/\/www.offroadindustries.com.au\/collections\/bds-suspension-australian-distributor\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">BDS<\/span><\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.offroadindustries.com.au\/collections\/fox_suspension_australian_distributor\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Fox Suspension<\/span><\/a>, but they’re also qualified to certify your vehicle before you drive it for the first time after upgrading. <\/p><p>Before you even purchase a RAM 2500 GVM upgrade from us, you can rest assured they’ve been engineered to comply with Australian Design Rules (ADR) and state-level certification requirements. <br\/><\/p><h3>What role do ORI coil packs play in the RAM 2500 GVM upgrade, and how do they enhance the suspension performance?<\/h3><p>Our own range of ORI coil packs and leaf kits are custom-engineered for your specific truck’s model to handle increased load and stress. Their primary job is to provide better support and stability for heavy-duty applications, meaning you can head off on your journey with confidence, knowing that we’ve designed them to add the support you need. You can expect a more consistent ride height, while also serving to reduce rear-end sag or buckling while you’re carrying all your gear. <br\/><\/p><h3>How does the GVM upgrade for my RAM 2500 reflect the latest off-road modification trends?<\/h3><p>When you’re investing in a vehicle as elite as a RAM 2500, you’re already a driver who demands more. While the original specs of this beast are already impressive, upgrading the suspension and GVM only enhance the existing features and functionality. To match your American-made truck, American-made aftermarket parts are designed to handle everything you want or need to put your RAM through - whether that’s for work or play. <br\/><\/p><h3>What’s the installation process for the RAM 2500 GVM upgrade, and how long does it take?<\/h3><p>When you book in with an authorised installer, the process typically begins with an initial inspection, especially if you already have some upgrades installed. Our RAM 2500 kits are designed especially for your model, so once you’re ready to go ahead with installation, typically you can expect it done within two to three business days though this may vary depending on location. Once everything is done, you’ll have a revved up truck, with all the road-worthy paperwork, allowing you to head out and go further. <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["text_73Mzb9"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"container":"container","color_schema":"","text_alignment":"left","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"container","custom_id":"","custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"rich_text_GbXVUF":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_XhCLHT":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"RAM 2500 GVM Upgrades: Carry More, Tow Better, Travel Farther","highlight_style":"none","enable_highlight_text_color":true,"heading_size":"h1","heading_color":"#56bdc2"}},"text_CfcJd4":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>If you’re ready to get the most from your Ram 2500, getting a GVM upgrade is for you. It isn’t just an upgrade or numbers on paper, Ram 2500 GVM upgrades give you  about changing a number on paper, more support, more rugged potential, and even greater abilities to haul heavy loads of gear. Generally, when you drive your Ram 2500 off the lot, you’ll be sitting in the NB1 category, which is a broad ranging limit when it comes to how much weight you can legally carry. Certain vehicles - like the Ram 2500 - are built for more and can easily be transformed into beasts with upgraded suspension and coils to do your hard-working truck justice. <\/p><p>If you’re left wanting more - whether that’s more gear, heavier tools, or some serious touring equipment when you’re heading off into the wilds of Australia, our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.offroadindustries.com.au\/pages\/ori-gvm-upgrades\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">GVM upgrades<\/span><\/a> can get you there. Discover the freedom of going further and explore the range of RAM 2500 GVM upgrades here at Offroad Industries. <br\/><br\/><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_XhCLHT","text_CfcJd4"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"container":"container","color_schema":"","text_alignment":"left","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":0,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"container","custom_id":"","custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"rich_text_t793Bx":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_QLD6GU":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"RAM 2500 GVM Upgrade Australia: Compliant & Certified Solutions","highlight_style":"none","enable_highlight_text_color":true,"heading_size":"h1","heading_color":"#56bdc2"}},"text_PgCwfk":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>When you get a GVM upgrade for your Ram 2500 with Offroad Industries, you’ll have everything you need. With installation and engineering all taken care of, all you need to do is choose which Stage you want. We can make sure everything is safe, compliant, and more powerful than you’ve experienced before. We’re a federally approved second-stage manufacturer, which means we can upgrade your RAM 2500 on the official federal database. <\/p><p>We’ve chosen the best combination of parts, including coils and suspension, all from top brands including the likes of <a href=\"https:\/\/www.offroadindustries.com.au\/collections\/fox_suspension_australian_distributor\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Fox Suspension<\/span><\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.offroadindustries.com.au\/collections\/bds-suspension-australian-distributor\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">BDS<\/span><\/a>, along with our own rugged ranges of parts and accessories. There’s nothing generic or ordinary when it comes to ORI - everything was designed specifically for the RAM 2500 platform and subjected to rigorous testing and certification. That means you get the performance and power you need, without sacrificing safety or control. <br\/><br\/><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_QLD6GU","text_PgCwfk"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"container":"container","color_schema":"","text_alignment":"left","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":0,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"container","custom_id":"","custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"rich_text_jLn8zi":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_XKgGWK":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"GVM Upgrade RAM 2500: Common Questions and What to Ask Your Installer","highlight_style":"none","enable_highlight_text_color":true,"heading_size":"h1","heading_color":"#56bdc2"}},"text_NxtAw3":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Before you commit to a Ram 2500 GVM upgrade pack, there are a few key things worth clarifying regarding your vehicle. First, you’ll want to check how the upgrade changes your total payload and towing limits on your specific truck, along with the Class it’ll be in if you get a certain upgrade completed. <\/p><p>You’ll also want to check whether your current <a href=\"https:\/\/www.offroadindustries.com.au\/collections\/4-play-wheels\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">wheels<\/span><\/a> and tyres are up for the job. With greater weight acting on them, along with a change in ground clearance, you may need to upgrade those too. <\/p><p>Finally, you might have questions regarding the timeframe and paperwork sign off, which we can help you with. If you have questions and want to speak to our team, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.offroadindustries.com.au\/pages\/contact-us\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">contact us<\/span><\/a> any time for more information. <br\/><br\/><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_XKgGWK","text_NxtAw3"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"container":"container","color_schema":"","text_alignment":"left","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":0,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"container","custom_id":"","custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"rich_text_Q49rHF":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_nDYqHW":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Top GVM Upgrade Packages for the RAM 2500 in Australia","highlight_style":"none","enable_highlight_text_color":true,"heading_size":"h1","heading_color":"#56bdc2"}},"text_DLYDz6":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Discover the true potential of your Ram 2500 and explore your options here at Offroad Industries. With each Stage having been engineered to suit different levels of demand, whether you want extra lift and more hauling power, or something seriously heavy duty, you’ll find a GVM upgrade option here. Whether you’re looking for something for daily hauling, heavy towing for weekend trips, or long-distance loaded touring across the toughest terrain, your RAM 2500 can truly reflect what it was built to do — work hard, go far and carry more with confidence. <br\/><br\/><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_nDYqHW","text_DLYDz6"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"container":"container","color_schema":"","text_alignment":"left","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":0,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"container","custom_id":"","custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"rich_text_PtmRiF":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_mpxUJy":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Ori Proposed GVM Packages","highlight_style":"underline","enable_highlight_text_color":true,"heading_size":"h1","heading_color":"#56bdc2"}}},"block_order":["heading_mpxUJy"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"container":"container","color_schema":"","text_alignment":"left","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":0,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"container","custom_id":"gvmpackages","custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"image_with_text_WcaAiR":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"subheading_JVKNjL":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"subheading":"Stage 1: $10,500 - Installed & Engineered","subheading_size":"h5"}},"heading_f9G7kD":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"STAGE 1 : 5300 GVM","highlight_style":"none","enable_highlight_text_color":false,"heading_size":"h2"}},"text_fRRw7g":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<ul><li>Fox 2.5 HTO Performance Series Suspension<\/li><li>ORI 50mm Front and Rear Coils<\/li><li>SSM Federally Approved GVM<\/li><li>Category Changes from NB1 to NB2<\/li><li>4459 Upgraded 